{
 "asset": "affect_table",
 "about": "The three affect ids the client names in code, plus one row per affect id used by the leader abilities and Mind abilities in dtbattle_ability_data_table. Each id names one BaseAffectType and one AffectCondition; the amount comes from the ability row (per-mille, negative for the *_SUB ids). Empty limit lists mean no cap. affectTextId is the game's own affectText_JP label with the same meaning (AFFECT_[COND_]STAT_OP_TEXT; DYING takes the near-death FNT labels, FULL_HP the FULL ones): the detail screens build the effect line from it, with the amounts merged by affect_text_rule_table. Rows AF_* are the action-battle affects of the leader and assist abilities and the JoJo Links (server/content/action_abilities.json, assist_abilities.json \"action\", jojo_links.json; docs/research/30-action-battle.md §7).",
 "sources": [
  {
   "source": "jdr-research",
   "doc": "docs/research/12-master-data-fill.md §1",
   "note": "ids from client string literals; baseAffect by the matching BaseAffectType name"
  },
  {
   "source": "jdr-default",
   "note": "no limits, prvs NONE, sort index 0"
  },
  {
   "source": "jdr-research",
   "doc": "docs/research/12-master-data-fill.md §4",
   "note": "units, slots and conditions read in the client code; see scripts/K_abilities.py header"
  },
  {
   "source": "jdr-default",
   "note": "affect id names are ours, in the DTAF_[COND_]STAT_OP style of the client's DTAF_* label keys; textSortIndex 0"
  },
  {
   "source": "jdr-research",
   "doc": "docs/research/16-minds.md §8",
   "note": "affectTextId: label keys and their placeholders ({decimal_Param0}, {mag_Param0}) read in the player's text.jp; the AFFECT_* label is chosen by meaning (M for DYING = near death)"
  },
  {
   "source": "jdr-default",
   "note": "AF_* action-battle affects (ours ids; units docs/research/30-action-battle.md §7): AF_[COND_]STAT_OP, prvs from the condition and baseAffect from the stat of the shared vocabulary tools/content/action_vocab.py"
  }
 ],
